ore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656393256","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:02:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5047110-1843481262705447","game_id":"steam-5047110","kind":"announcement","title":"Wardspire 0.12.0 - The waves answer back","summary":"Wardspire 0.12.0 - The waves answer back Demo build, 14 September 2026 - Windows and Linux. This demo covers the first three worlds - Midgard, Alfheim and Vanaheim - on Normal difficulty. Your progress is kept between sessions. {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46250443/be4f99a8865cb7eae051bcc76efd931edc171129.png New Wave choice. \"Start wave\" now lays two cards on the field: the wave as the map intends it, or the same wave with a twist and more gold per kill - Iron Wall, Onslaught, Wrath of the Sky or Overwhe","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-15T19:05:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262705447","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:02:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5047110-1842212951297863","game_id":"steam-5047110","kind":"announcement","title":"The demo is out - and here is what comes next","summary":"Play the first three realms The Wardspire demo is live: Midgard, Alfheim and Vanaheim, twenty waves each, on Normal. The Forge comes with it - every victory pays Glory, and what you unlock stays unlocked between runs. Windows and Linux. There is no time limit and nothing gets wiped. Where something belongs to the full version, the game says so plainly instead of walking you into a dead end. {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46250443/263153d92668f6ab3d4e9dc4b4dacc519fc6444e.png A god at your back Beat a world b","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-26T18:41:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcement